        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1721"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1265" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1266">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>we lost another one, at that time Henry died? We just buried Dorothy. Remember two days, and then Ned. They went down; they had a big party in Teslin.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
